BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:earth-partner-prize-2026@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20260901T205350Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261007
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261008
SUMMARY:Deadline: Earth Partner Prize 2026 (climate and ecological justice\
 , ages 14 to 30)
DESCRIPTION:The Earth Partner Prize is a global open call for young creativ
 es making work about climate action and ecological justice\, run by Earth 
 Partner with the Global Environment Facility and Re:wild\, and timed to am
 plify youth voices ahead of the UN climate conference in November 2026. IT
  IS NOT A PHOTOGRAPHY PRIZE: the call takes work across disciplines\, and 
 the organisers explicitly list photography projects\, docu-style and exper
 imental film\, performance art\, app development\, spoken word\, musical c
 ompositions\, dance\, fashion design\, new media and social media projects
 . PRIZES: USD 10\,000 for first prize\, USD 5\,000 each for two runners-up
